sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App Init
    participant ES as Exercises Store
    participant SS as Settings Store
    participant ER as Exercises Repository
    participant SR as Settings Repository
    participant DB as IndexedDB

    Note over App,DB: 🚀 App Initialization (Load-Once Pattern)

    App->>ES: loadFromDb()
    ES->>ER: getAll()
    ER->>DB: Query exercises
    DB-->>ER: DbCustomExercise[]
    ER-->>ES: CustomExercise[]
    ES->>ES: Cache in memory
    Note over ES: isLoaded = true

    App->>SS: loadFromDb()
    SS->>SR: getAll()
    SR->>DB: Query settings
    DB-->>SR: DbUserSetting[]
    SR-->>SS: SettingDefaults
    SS->>SS: Cache in memory
    Note over SS: isLoaded = true

    Note over App,DB: ✏️ Add Exercise (DB-First Pattern)

    App->>ES: addExercise(exercise)
    ES->>ER: add(dbExercise)
    ER->>DB: Insert
    DB-->>ER: Success
    ER-->>ES: void
    ES->>ES: Update cache
    Note over ES: customExercises.value = [...old, new]
    ES-->>App: newExercise

    Note over App,DB: ⚙️ Update Setting (DB-First Pattern)

    App->>SS: setWeightUnit('kg')
    SS->>SR: set({key: 'weightUnit', value: 'kg'})
    SR->>DB: Update
    DB-->>SR: Success
    SR-->>SS: void
    SS->>SS: Update cache
    Note over SS: weightUnit.value = 'kg'
    SS-->>App: void

    Note over App,DB: 🔍 Read from Store (Synchronous!)

    App->>ES: getAllExercises()
    ES-->>App: CustomExercise[] (from cache)

    App->>SS: getWeightUnit()
    SS-->>App: 'kg' (from cache)